@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Buscar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar opções de clinetes
GET {{host}}/api/customers/options

### Buscar faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar faturas pelo indentificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### busca fatura por indetificador indisponivel
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/99999

### buscar fatura por indetificador iválido
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc

### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId":1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Altera fatura
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/181
Content-Type: application/json

 {
     "customerId":1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
 }

 ### Deleta fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/181
